{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a splashing good time in Smoots Crazy Wave! This fast-paced arcade racer brings the beloved Smoots characters to thrilling water tracks where you\u2019ll compete for victory. Whether you prefer classic Slalom races, powerup-filled mayhem, or intense Battle Royale showdowns, there's a mode for every type of racer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/68522848e296b8ac2abf988df1b598ba.poster.avif?t=1753776145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/68522848e296b8ac2abf988df1b598ba.webm?t=1753776145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/68522848e296b8ac2abf988df1b598ba.mp4?t=1753776145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across vibrant locations like Honu Island, Iceland, and the mysterious Lost World, using skill and strategy to outpace your rivals. And if you\u2019re falling behind, grab a powerup to turn the tide! Play solo or challenge up to 3 friends in local multiplayer to prove who rules the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/25582a110a5e06d5bf90aa99ecf4fa33.poster.avif?t=1753776145\" width=650 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/25582a110a5e06d5bf90aa99ecf4fa33.webm?t=1753776145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/25582a110a5e06d5bf90aa99ecf4fa33.mp4?t=1753776145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer: Up to 4 players can race together in split-screen mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting game modes: Choose from Slalom, Battle Royale, Time Trial, Exhibition, and practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 unique Smoots: Each character has their own stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful tracks: Race across exotic locations, from tropical beaches to icy landscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to ride the waves?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844020?t=1753776145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/942d8fa2303d2abd30135d1d3b61795c6af7ac7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753776145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/b76520bef86ec8fe7e48d50aadc27e80031588ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753776145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/b76520bef86ec8fe7e48d50aadc27e80031588ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753776145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a splashing good time in Smoots Crazy Wave! This fast-paced arcade racer brings 